## Module 2: The Adaptive Interviewer (Mock Coach)

### Master Form (1)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Interview Configuration | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (DataGrid) |

### Transaction Forms (3)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Hardware Check | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (DataGrid) |
| Mock Interview Session | ✅ | ✅ (cancel) | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Interview Evaluation | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

### Master Table (1)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Interviews | Interview session details |

### Transaction Tables (4)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Interview_Questions | AI-generated questions |
| Interview_Responses | Student answers (text/audio) |
| Interview_Scores | Confidence, fluency, technical score |
| Speech_Transcripts | Whisper AI transcription results |

### Report
Interview Performance Report — Evaluation with confidence, clarity, relevance, technical accuracy, grade, and transcript

### Visualization
Interview Score Cards — Per-interview score display with color-coded percentage and status badges

### API
[interview.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/interview.routes.ts) — POST `/`, GET `/`, GET [/:id](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/job.routes.ts#9-21), POST `/:id/start`, GET `/:id/next-question`, POST `/:id/answer`, POST `/:id/complete`, GET `/:id/evaluation`, POST `/:id/cancel`, GET `/:id/metrics`

### Testing
Frontend: Jest + React Testing Library | Backend: pytest + pytest-asyncio (cognitive-screener microservice)

