## Module 3: The Autonomous Headhunter (Agentic Core)

### Master Form (1)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Outreach Preferences | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

### Transaction Forms (3)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Email Signature & Template | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Job Save/Bookmark | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Job Application | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

### Master Table (1)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Alumni | Alumni profiles and company details |

### Transaction Tables (4)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Outreach_Requests | Student outreach eligibility |
| Email_Logs | Sent email records |
| Alumni_Responses | Replies and referral confirmations |
| Referral_Status | Tracks referral outcomes |

### Report
Job Match Report — Skill-based job matching with match score %, requirements comparison, and saved jobs tracking

### Visualization
Job Match Score Badges — Color-coded match % badges (green ≥85%, yellow ≥70%, red <70%) per job listing

### API
[headhunter.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/headhunter.routes.ts) — GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/campaigns`, GET/POST/PUT/DELETE `/templates`
[job.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/job.routes.ts) — GET `/`, GET [/:id](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/job.routes.ts#9-21), POST `/:id/apply`, GET `/saved`, POST `/save`, DELETE `/unsave/:jobId`, GET `/user/recommended`

### Testing
Frontend: Jest + React Testing Library | Backend: Jest + ts-jest (API Gateway)

