## Module 4: The Analytics Manager (Admin Dashboard)

### Master Form (1)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Alumni Database Update | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (by email) | ✅ |

### Transaction Forms (3)
| Form | Insert | Delete | Update | Search | Display |
|------|--------|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| Report Generation Filter | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (by ID/title) | ✅ |
| Placement Prediction Generation | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ (by email/name) | ✅ |
| User Registration | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

### Master Table (1)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Student_Readiness | Combined readiness score |

### Transaction Tables (4)
| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| Skill_Gap_Reports | Missing skills and recommendations |
| Placement_Predictions | Probability estimates |
| Batch_Statistics | Department & batch analytics |
| Dashboard_Metrics | Cached data for fast dashboard loading |

### Report
Placement Predictions Report — AI-calculated placement probability per student with risk levels, estimated package, and recommendations

### Visualization
Admin Dashboard Charts — Placement Trend (Line), Department Distribution (Doughnut), Skill Gap (Bar), Stat Cards, Readiness Progress Bars

### API
[analytics.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/analytics.routes.ts) — GET `/admin/dashboard`, `/admin/placement-stats`, `/admin/batch-analytics`, `/admin/department-analytics`, `/admin/skill-gap-report`, `/admin/company-analytics`, `/admin/trends`, `/reports/placement`, `/reports/batch/:batch`
[placementReport.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/placementReport.routes.ts) — Full CRUD for placement reports
[placementPrediction.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/placementPrediction.routes.ts) — Full CRUD for placement predictions
[alumniAdmin.routes.ts](file:///c:/Users/naren/OneDrive/Desktop/SEM-6/FFS%27/CareerForge/backend/api-gateway/src/routes/alumniAdmin.routes.ts) — Full CRUD for alumni records

### Testing
Frontend: Jest + React Testing Library | Backend: Jest + ts-jest (API Gateway)

