| Metric | Module 1 | Module 2 | Module 3 | Module 4 | **Total** |
|--------|----------|----------|----------|----------|-----------|
| Master Forms | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | **4** |
| Transaction Forms | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | **12** |
| Master Tables | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | **5** |
| Transaction Tables | 3 | 4 | 4 | 4 | **15** |
| Reports | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | **4** |
| Visualizations | 1 | 1 | 1 | 1 | **4** |
| APIs | 3 routes | 1 route | 2 routes | 4 routes | **10 route files** |
| Testing | Jest + pytest | Jest + pytest | Jest + ts-jest | Jest + ts-jest | **3 frameworks** |
